  "_comment": "Auto-approve list for mayor (city-scoped claude sessions run on host by the shim's passthrough branch). Anything not in `allow` still prompts. Nothing is in `deny` — we don't blanket-block anything; you can always approve destructive stuff yourself. Ship this via `--settings` from the shim so it doesn't affect ad-hoc claude sessions in the same cwd.",
